**Why is an ITIN Required:**\\n   - Some legal transactions, such as opening a bank account or getting a mortgage, may require an ITIN.\\n   - If the client earns income in the U.S. and is not eligible for an SSN, an ITIN is necessary for filing taxes.\\n\\n5. **ITIN Processing Time:**\\n   - It usually takes approximately four months to receive an ITIN from the IRS. This processing time is solely determined by the IRS and not within our office&#x27;s control.\\n\\n6. **Client Identification Handling:**\\n   - As a certified office, we only need to take a copy of their ID for ITIN application; there is no need to send the original ID, reducing the risk of losing identification.\\n\\nOnce the client obtains their ITIN, they&#x27;ll be able to apply for a Business Federal Employer Identification Number (EIN) if needed.\\n\\nI hope this cheat sheet helps you in assisting your clients effectively. If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask."\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "finish_details"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "&lt;|diff_marker|&gt;"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "is_complete"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight