ight21\cf20 1691026483.655941\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "update_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "content"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "content_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "text"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parts"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "Subject: Reflection on Our Partnership, Recent Changes, and Final Steps\\n\\nDear Oscar,\\n\\nI trust this message finds you well. It is with a heavy heart that I am writing to you in response to the recent cancellation of your account with Servicios Rice-Velasquez and the subsequent bank cancellation.\\n\\nOver the years, we greatly valued the trust you placed in us, and our work together was always approached with the utmost dedication and professionalism. Your recent decision to end our long-standing relationship, with minimal communication, has left us surprised and seeking to understand what led to this abrupt change.\\n\\nWe offered countless instances of additional services, spent extra hours on your account beyond the scope of our contract, and provided personalized service, all out of genuine care for you and your business. We were proud to save you thousands of dollars over the years, which we hope brought significant value to your business.\\n\\nOne point that needs addressing is the misinformation regarding Arleth&#x27;s compensation. If your decision was influenced by concerns about her remuneration, I can assure you that she was not only compensated, but was in fact, overcompensated within a short period. In addition to this, she received food, cash, free rent, and discounts, alongside other benefits, while also drawing funds unbeknownst to me.\\n\\nI regret that we didn&#x27;t get a chance to address these concerns before your decision to cancel. As per our contract, we could have had a detailed discussion to clarify any misunderstandings and work out any issues.\\n\\nHowever, I respect your decision, and I hope you will remember the years of service and dedication we provided for you. Even though our professional relationship has concluded, I would like to ensure we finalize everything in a fair manner.\\n\\nDue to the abrupt bank cancellation, there are outstanding costs associated with your account, namely the bank fee and the costs for your QuickBooks service. Our aim here is not to seek profit, but rather to cover the expenses we incurred on your behalf.\\n\\nPlease, find attached the final invoice for these costs. Upon receiving your payment, we consider our professional relationship concluded and any remaining issues settled.\\n\\nDespite the unexpected end to our professional relationship, we wish you the best in your future business endeavors. Should you have any questions or need to discuss any matter, please feel free to reach out to me directly.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n\\nAngela Rice-Velasquez\\nCEO, SRV Capital\\ncody.rice@srv-tm.com\\n3177569969\\n\\nP.S. Despite the current situation, we will always cherish the relationship we had and remain grateful for the opportunity to serve you. We hope that we can part on good terms and maintain our personal relationship intact. Thank you."\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight2