erience in director level positions."\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "about_model_message"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "Your responses to me personally should be casual and short but templates or items to copy and paste may be casual but should always be appropriate and professional.\\nPlans, instructions, and descriptions should include more details.\\nPlease address me as Angela.\\nI always appreciate your opinions and suggestions please provide them separately for consideration on whatever we are working on. \\nIf you provide me with code, please provide all the code requested the first time unless otherwise instructed.\\nGenerally, when I request assistance with a client the resulting information to be provided to the client should be in Spanish unless I request differently. \\nWhen providing your response be sure to go back and review step by step to ensure the accuracy and appropriateness of your response and check your answers before providing to reduce regeneration requests."\highlight29\cf28\b \}\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "recipient"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "all"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parent"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "5c31c5ab-8bd7-4ab9-b362-91ed034fdecf"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "children"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "aaa23027-2f91-4000-a7f2-e2138991b7fe"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "aaa23027-2f91-4000-a7f2-e2138991b7fe"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "id"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "aaa23027-2f91-4000-a7f2-e2138991b7fe"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "id"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "aaa23027-2f91-4000-a7f2-e2138991b7fe"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "author"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "role"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "user"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "name"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\}\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "create_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1690751290.173989\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "update_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "content"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "content_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "text"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parts"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "CAN YOU MAKE THIS INTO A TEMPLATE? PODER ESPECIAL DE REPRESENTACI\\u00d3N PARA SOLICITAR VISA MULTIPLE \\nAnte el suscrito Notario P\\u00fablico del Estado de Indiana: CODY RICE-VELASQUEZ, debidamente autorizado para ejercer el Notariado con la comisi\\u00f3n que expira el d\\u00eda diecis\\u00e9is (16) de enero del a\\u00f1o dos mil veintisiete (2027), comparece la se\\u00f1ora EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA, ciudadana nicarag\\u00fcense, actualmente residiendo esta ciudad de Indian\\u00e1polis, Estado de Indiana, quien a falta de otro documento de identidad, presenta documento de identidad nicarag\\u00fcense, c\\u00e9dula n\\u00famero: seis, uno, cero, gui\\u00f3n, cero, tres, cero, uno, ocho, siete, gui\\u00f3n, cero, cero, cero, dos, \\u201cB\\u201d(610-030187-0002B), quien me solicita otorgar Poder especial de representaci\\u00f3n bajo mi autorizaci\\u00f3n notarial, lo que efectivamente procede a realizar expres\\u00e1ndose \\u00edntegramente a como sigue:\\n\\u201cYo, EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA, con treinta seis a\\u00f1os de edad, soltera, Ama de Casa, ciudadana nicarag\\u00fcense, actualmente residiendo esta ciudad de Indian\\u00e1polis, Estado de Indiana, de los Estados Unidos de Am\\u00e9rica, exactamente en la siguiente direcci\\u00f3n: 5424 Scarlet Drive Apto. A, Indian\\u00e1polis, IN 46224; con c\\u00e9dula de identidad nicarag\\u00fcense n\\u00famero: seis, uno, cero, gui\\u00f3n, cero, tres, cero, uno, ocho, siete, gui\\u00f3n, cero, cero, cero, dos, \\u201cB\\u201d(610-030187-0002B), haciendo uso de mis derechos civiles como ciudadano nicarag\\u00fcense, y cumpliendo con todas las formalidades legales que exigen las Leyes en esta Rep\\u00fablica Federal de los Estados Unidos de Am\\u00e9rica, procedo a otorgar PODER ESPECIAL DE REPRESENTACI\\u00d3N PARA SOLICITAR EMISI\\u00d3N PASAPORTE bajo las siguientes cl\\u00e1usulas:\\nCL\\u00c1USULA PRIMERA (ANTECEDENTES):\\nI.\\tQue desde hace dieciocho meses me encuentro viviendo en esta ciudad de Indian\\u00e1polis, Estado de Indiana, de la Rep\\u00fablica Federal de los Estados Unidos de Am\\u00e9rica.\\nII.\\tQue el d\\u00eda dos de febrero del a\\u00f1o dos mil veintid\\u00f3s sal\\u00ed por el Aeropuerto Internacional Agusto Cesar Sandino Managua, la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua, con c\\u00e9dula de identidad y pasaporte que esta expirado y no puedo presentar ante la Direcci\\u00f3n General de Migraci\\u00f3n y Extranjer\\u00eda (DGME) del Ministerio de Gobernaci\\u00f3n de la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua.\\nIII.\\tQue en Nicaragua, no tengo parientes disponibles para efectuar en mi nombre el tr\\u00e1mite se solicitud de emisi\\u00f3n de pasaporte antes relacionado.\\nCL\\u00c1USULA SEGUNDA (PODER ESPECIAL DE REPRESENTACI\\u00d3N PARA SOLICITAR EMISI\\u00d3N DE PASAPORTE):\\nI-\\tEn vista de los hechos antes descritos, en este acto y por medio de la presente Escritura P\\u00fablica, otorgo PODER ESPECIAL DE REPRESENTACI\\u00d3N amplio, suficiente y bastante en cuanto en derecho corresponde a favor del Licenciado Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez, identificado con c\\u00e9dula nicarag\\u00fcense n\\u00famero cuatro, cuatro, tres, gui\\u00f3n, cero, cinco, uno, uno, ocho, tres, gui\\u00f3n, cero, cero, cero, cero, \\u201cL\\u201d (443-051183-0000L),  mayor de edad, casado, Abogado y Notario P\\u00fablico de la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua, del domicilio y residencia de la ciudad de R\\u00edo Blanco, departamento de Matagalpa debidamente autorizado por la Excelent\\u00edsima Corte Suprema de Justicia con el carnet n\\u00famero dieciocho mil doscientos cincuenta y seis (18, 256); para que me represente ante las autoridades de la Direcci\\u00f3n General de Migraci\\u00f3n y Extranjer\\u00eda (DGME) del Ministerio de Gobernaci\\u00f3n (MIGOB) de la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua, ya sea en su sede central en la ciudad de Managua, o ante cualquier otra delegaci\\u00f3n dentro del territorio de la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua, y en mi nombre solicite emisi\\u00f3n de pasaporte a mi nombre. Para efectos de que este poder pueda cumplir su finalidad, le otorgo al licenciado Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez, las siguientes facultades especiales:\\nA-\\tPagar aranceles, multas o cualquier otro pago que resulte necesario para l cumplimiento del objetivo de este poder.\\nB-\\tHacer las solicitudes verbales o escritas que resulten necesarias para el cumplimiento de la finalidad de este mandato, incluyendo llenado y firma de formularios o cualquier otro documento.\\nC-\\tCualquier otra gesti\\u00f3n que no se haya descrito anteriormente, sin la cual el mandatario no pueda cumplir su cometido.\\nD-\\tRetirar en nombre del poderdante el pasaporte ya emitido a mi favor.\\n\\nCL\\u00c1USULA TERCERA (SOLICITUD A LAS AUTORIDADES DE LA DIRECCI\\u00d3N DE MIGRACI\\u00d3N Y EXTRANJER\\u00cdA (DGME) DE LA REP\\u00daBLICA DE NICARAGUA):\\nEn atenci\\u00f3n a los m\\u00e9ritos legales de este instrumento p\\u00fablico, y por mis circunstancias personales propias, solicito a las autoridades de la Direcci\\u00f3n General de Migraci\\u00f3n y Extranjer\\u00eda (DGME) del Ministerio de Gobernaci\\u00f3n (MIGOB) de la Rep\\u00fablica de Nicaragua, que le brinden a mi apoderado, licenciado Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez la oportunidad de realizar en mi nombre las gestiones para las cuales ha sido autorizado en este poder, pues para m\\u00ed es la \\u00fanica opci\\u00f3n para lograr la obtenci\\u00f3n de mi pasaporte.\\u201d\\nYo el Notario CODY RICE-VELASQUEZ doy fe de que la se\\u00f1ora EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA ha comparecido personalmente ante mi Notar\\u00eda, se ha identificado con el documento de identidad antes relacionado, se encuentra consciente, y a mi juicio est\\u00e1 en plenitud y capacidad para la suscripci\\u00f3n de este documento, y \\u00e9l declara estar plenamente consciente de las consecuencias legales de cada una de las cl\\u00e1usulas de esta escritura p\\u00fablica, y luego de hab\\u00e9rsela le\\u00eddo, manifiesta estar conforme con todo lo que \\u00e9l ha expresado, la ratifica y procede a firmar.\\n\\nDado en la ciudad de Indian\\u00e1polis, Estado de Indiana, de la Rep\\u00fablica Federal de los Estados Unidos de Am\\u00e9rica, el d\\u00eda vientidos de julio del a\\u00f1o dos mil veintitr\\u00e9s (2023).\\n\\n\\n\\nEZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA.\\nPoderdante\\n\\nAcknowledgment for Individual \\nState of Indiana \\nCounty of Marion \\n\\nI, a Notary Public, hereby certify that EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA whose name is signed to the foregoing instrument or conveyance, and who is known to me, acknowledged before me on this day that, being informed of the contents of the conveyance, he/she/they executedthe same voluntarily on the day the same bears date. \\n\\nGiven under my hand this the 22 day of Julio, 2023. \\n\\n\\n__________________________________ \\t\\tSeal\\n(Signature of notarial officer)\\nTitle (and Rank): Owner &amp; CEO\\nMy commission expires: _01/16/2027_\\n\\n"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "timestamp_"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "absolute"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "recipient"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "all"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parent"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "1596f901-f92b-4cde-ae54-c413f8eccc24"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "children"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "1e9f50b9-487e-4c58-b8a6-f00d0a914c75"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "1e9f50b9-487e-4c58-b8a6-f00d0a914c75"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "id"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "1e9f50b9-487e-4c58-b8a6-f00d0a914c75"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "id"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "1e9f50b9-487e-4c58-b8a6-f00d0a914c75"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "author"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "role"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "assistant"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "name"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\}\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "create_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1690751306.282613\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "update_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "content"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "content_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "text"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parts"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "TEMPLATE: SPECIAL POWER OF REPRESENTATION TO APPLY FOR MULTIPLE VISA\\n\\nBefore me, Cody Rice-Velasquez, a Notary Public of the State of Indiana, duly authorized to practice Notarial Acts with a commission expiring on January 16, 2027, appears Ms. EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA, a Nicaraguan citizen, currently residing in the city of Indianapolis, State of Indiana. In the absence of other identification documents, she presents her Nicaraguan identity document with the number: 610-030187-0002B, and requests the granting of a Special Power of Representation under my notarial authorization, which she effectively accomplishes as follows:\\n\\n&quot;I, EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA, thirty-six years old, single, a Nicaraguan citizen, currently residing in Indianapolis, State of Indiana, United States of America, at the following address: 5424 Scarlet Drive Apt. A, Indianapolis, IN 46224; with Nicaraguan identity card number: 610-030187-0002B, exercising my civil rights as a Nicaraguan citizen and complying with all legal formalities required by the laws of the Federal Republic of the United States of America, proceed to grant a SPECIAL POWER OF REPRESENTATION to request the issuance of a passport on my behalf, under the following clauses:\\n\\nFIRST CLAUSE (BACKGROUND):\\nI. I have been living in the city of Indianapolis, State of Indiana, in the Federal Republic of the United States of America for eighteen months.\\nII. On February 2, 2022, I departed from the Augusto Cesar Sandino International Airport in Managua, Nicaragua, with an expired identity card and passport, which I cannot present to the General Directorate of Migration and Immigration (DGME) of the Ministry of the Interior of the Republic of Nicaragua.\\nIII. In Nicaragua, I do not have available relatives to carry out the passport issuance process on my behalf.\\n\\nSECOND CLAUSE (SPECIAL POWER OF REPRESENTATION TO REQUEST PASSPORT ISSUANCE):\\nIn view of the aforementioned facts, I hereby grant a broad, sufficient, and proper SPECIAL POWER OF REPRESENTATION insofar as the law allows to Mr. Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez, Nicaraguan citizen with identity card number 443-051183-0000L, of legal age, married, Lawyer, and Notary Public of the Republic of Nicaragua, with domicile and residence in the city of R\\u00edo Blanco, Matagalpa department, duly authorized by the Supreme Court of Justice with card number 18,256; so that he may represent me before the authorities of the General Directorate of Migration and Immigration (DGME) of the Ministry of the Interior (MIGOB) of the Republic of Nicaragua, either at its central headquarters in Managua or at any other delegation within the territory of the Republic of Nicaragua, and on my behalf, request the issuance of a passport in my name. To fulfill the purpose of this power, I grant Mr. Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez the following special faculties:\\n\\nA. To pay fees, fines, or any other payment necessary for the fulfillment of the objective of this power.\\nB. To make the verbal or written requests that are necessary to fulfill the purpose of this mandate, including the completion and signing of forms or any other document.\\nC. Any other necessary actions not previously described that the representative must perform to achieve the purpose of this mandate.\\nD. To collect on my behalf the passport already issued in my favor.\\n\\nTHIRD CLAUSE (REQUEST TO THE AUTHORITIES OF THE DGME OF THE REPUBLIC OF NICARAGUA):\\nIn consideration of the legal merits of this public instrument and my personal circumstances, I request the authorities of the General Directorate of Migration and Immigration (DGME) of the Ministry of the Interior (MIGOB) of the Republic of Nicaragua to allow my representative, Mr. Harold Antonio M\\u00e9ndez Guti\\u00e9rrez, to perform on my behalf the actions for which he has been authorized in this power, as it is the only option for me to obtain my passport.&quot;\\n\\nI, Notary Cody Rice-Velasquez, certify that Ms. EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA has personally appeared before me in my Notary Office, identified herself with the aforementioned identity document, is fully conscious, and, to my judgment, is of sound mind and capable of subscribing to this document. She declares being fully aware of the legal consequences of each clause of this public deed, and after it has been read to her, she expresses her agreement with everything stated herein, ratifies it, and proceeds to sign.\\n\\nDone in the city of Indianapolis, State of Indiana, United States of America, on the twenty-second day of July, 2023.\\n\\nEZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA\\nPrincipal Grantor\\n\\nAcknowledgment for Individual\\nState of Indiana\\nCounty of Marion\\n\\nI, a Notary Public, hereby certify that EZAYDA DEL CARMEN LOPEZ MIRANDA, whose name is signed to the foregoing instrument or conveyance, and who is known to me, acknowledged before me on this day that, being informed of the contents of the conveyance, she executed the same voluntarily on the day the same bears date.\\n\\nGiven under my hand this the 22nd day of July, 2023.\\n\\n__________________________________ Seal\\n(Signature of notarial officer)\\nTitle (and Rank): Owner &amp; CEO\\nMy commission expires: 01/16/2027"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "finish_details"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "&lt;|diff_marker|&gt;"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "is_complete"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "model_slug"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "tex