ttle circles with the little circles we use the embosser. And then I do have some labels that can be printed out. I haven&#x27;t really decided if we should do both or just one or the other, but those are the options that are available. I would say until we really get to hang on things, it&#x27;s better to have more and not need it than to do less and then have needed it. Like when the one box got lost, they were asking, well, did you guys put any kind of stickers on it? Any kind of markings? And in my head, I&#x27;m thinking, hmm, it&#x27;s actually a pretty good idea. Should have had something on it, huh? But again, that&#x27;s not something that was instructed. Also, this box that came in, it did seem to be kind of heavy, so I did actually pull out the weight to check it. Also, always make sure when you are checking the weight that it&#x27;s in pounds and not kilograms. I do believe the weight defaults to kilograms."\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "timestamp_"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "absolute"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "recipient"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "all"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parent"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\