uter at the front desk.\\n- They see the Teams app open with a clear label like &quot;Call Here.&quot;\\n- They click on the app, and the call is automatically connected to your Teams account in the back.\\n\\nAnd vice versa, when you call the computer up front from your Teams app in the back, it will auto-answer, allowing you to communicate easily.\\n\\nRemember to test the setup to ensure it&#x27;s working as expected before using it with clients. Additionally, consider adding a simple instruction sign with the word &quot;Call&quot; and an arrow pointing to the Teams app for further clarity.\\n\\nKeep it simple and straightforward, and your clients will have no trouble using the system."\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "finish_details"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "stop"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "&lt;|diff_marker|&gt;"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "is_complete"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "model_slug"\highlight29\cf28\b :\