cks\\n\\nThanks,\\n\\nSeems like he has a real rude attitude in this email and I don\\u2019t appreciate it. Please understand he\\u2019s showing me two checks that bounce so that means out of the three checks I gave them one of them to clear when I checked the account. All three of them had cleared. Yes, there was a negative balance in my account, and it was due to another transaction from Microsoft that was erroneous which resulted into negative account again and yes, it would be their luck that this happened to them a second time but I need him to realize it\\u2019s not like The last 2 1/2 years and I don\\u2019t know how much tens of thousands of dollars I have all went through so this is a temporary and recent issue and I feel as if she\\u2019s not taking into consideration the situation she\\u2019s immediately assuming some type of negligence or some type of incompetence and I really don\\u2019t appreciate it maybe that\\u2019s how they operate in other places, but here we expect that there should always be an assumption of good faith. Now I would have to also mention to him that once again once his staff came to pick up those boxes. They were rude to me. They were short with me almost like they were looking down at me because of the issue with the check I literally have tens of thousands of dollars moving in and out of these accounts, there\\u2019s no reason for any kind of short notice or lack of respect or common courtesy and profession Aliti so they you guys updated your prices is but you do not provide any updated marketing materials when your staff came to my office they ripped all the papers off the boxes and provided no assistance on fixing that or any kind of market materials so the Monday evening I spent approximately 2 1/2 hours, formulating printing and laminating sheets with the with the new prices and information for the new boxes so again how would you appreciate it if I sent you an email with this kind of tone that you\\u2019re sending me an email? I don\\u2019t think I\\u2019d appreciate if I was like oh, your staff is crap and you guys are so disorganized and this is not the first time that you have been nonchalant about Updates I want to. I definitely want to and I think it is beneficial for my company and yours to continue working together all I\\u2019m asking is for a little bit more courtesy personality, OK?"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "timestamp_"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "absolute"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "message_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "recipient"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "all"\highlight29\cf28\b \},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parent"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "fe2bd14d-8e2f-4a94-bb51-87c533f9783f"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "children"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "830d3b4c-3c38-4b78-8d55-bd764b73aab0"\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "830d3b4c-3c38-4b78-8d55-bd764b73aab0"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "id"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "830d3b4c-3c38-4b78-8d55-bd764b73aab0"\highlight2