0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\}\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "create_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1689735388.236861\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "update_time"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 null\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "content"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "content_type"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "text"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "parts"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b [\highlight27\cf26\b0 "Subject: Important Notice Regarding the Corporate Transparency Act (CTA) - English Version\\n\\nDear Valued Clients and Subscribers,\\n\\nWe hope this message finds you well. We would like to inform you about an important new law known as the Corporate Transparency Act (CTA) and its accompanying regulations that will be implemented next year. This law focuses on anti-money laundering efforts and is overseen by the Financial Crimes Enforcement Network (FinCEN).\\n\\nThe CTA specifically applies to businesses involved in money services such as money transfers, loans, cash checking, and money orders. If your company does not primarily engage in these types of activities, the CTA regulations may not be applicable to you.\\n\\nStarting from January 1st of next year, the CTA requires covered businesses to submit a report by the end of January, providing beneficial ownership information. Beneficial ownership refers to individuals who ultimately own or control the company.\\n\\nAt Servicios Rice-Velasquez, we take compliance with the CTA seriously and are committed to maintaining transparency in our operations. We will ensure that the necessary reporting requirements are met within the prescribed timeframe.\\n\\nFor further information or if you have any questions regarding the CTA and its impact on your business, please feel free to contact our dedicated team of experts. We are here to assist you every step of the way.\\n\\nThank you for your attention, and we greatly appreciate your continued trust and partnership.\\n\\nSincerely,\\n\\n[Your Name]\\nSenior Accountant\\nServicios Rice-Velasquez\\n\\n---\\n\\nAsunto: Aviso Importante sobre la Ley de Transparencia Corporativa (CTA) - Versi\\u00f3n en Espa\\u00f1ol\\n\\nEstimados clientes y suscriptores valiosos,\\n\\nEsperamos que este mensaje les encuentre bien. Nos gustar\\u00eda informarles sobre una nueva ley importante conocida como la Ley de Transparencia Corporativa (CTA) y sus respectivas regulaciones que se implementar\\u00e1n el pr\\u00f3ximo a\\u00f1o. Esta ley se centra en los esfuerzos de prevenci\\u00f3n del lavado de dinero y est\\u00e1 supervisada por la Red de Control de Delitos Financieros (FinCEN).\\n\\nLa CTA se aplica espec\\u00edficamente a empresas que ofrecen servicios monetarios como transferencias de dinero, pr\\u00e9stamos, cheques de efectivo y giros bancarios. Si su empresa no se dedica principalmente a este tipo de actividades, es posible que las regulaciones de la CTA no le sean aplicables.\\n\\nA partir del 1 de enero del pr\\u00f3ximo a\\u00f1o, la CTA exige que las empresas cubiertas presenten un informe antes de finales de enero, proporcionando informaci\\u00f3n sobre la propiedad beneficiaria. La propiedad beneficiaria se refiere a las personas que poseen o controlan en \\u00faltima instancia la empresa.\\n\\nEn Servicios Rice-Velasquez, nos tomamos muy en serio el cumplimiento de la CTA y nos comprometemos a mantener la transparencia en nuestras operaciones. Nos aseguraremos de cumplir con los requisitos de informe necesarios dentro del plazo establecido.\\n\\nPara obtener m\\u00e1s informaci\\u00f3n o si tiene alguna pregunta sobre la CTA y su impacto en su empresa, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nuestro dedicado equipo de expertos. Estamos aqu\\u00ed para ayud