 continue their routine.\\n\\n**12:00 PM**:\\nThe music volume reaches its maximum level, and the bed vibrator shakes as strongly as it can. The smart speaker asks you for the passphrase. \\n\\nOnly when you say &quot;I would like to have some super califragilisticexpialidocious on the side, drivers license number 17 20 65 96 56&quot;, will everything be turned off.\\n\\nRemember, all these actions can be set up with routines or flows in Google Home or Alexa (or another smart home controller). However, you may need to use third-party apps or integrations to control certain devices. For example, the Roku TV might need to be controlled using a service like Harmony, or the vibrator might need to be controlled using its own app or a smart plug.\\n\\nThe exact setup will depend on the specific devices you have and the integrations they support. If you can&#x27;t set up everything using one system, you might need to use a more complex setup with several different apps and services. \\n\\nIn addition, for the voice passphrase, you can set up a routine with Google Home to recognize the specific phrase and then stop the alarm, but I&#x27;m not aware of a similar functionality with Alexa as of my knowledge cutoff in September 2021. Please check the most current capabilities of your devices."\highlight29\cf28\b ]\},\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "status"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "finished_successfully"\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "end_turn"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight25\cf24\b\i0 true\highlight29\cf28\i0 ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "weight"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight21\cf20 1.0\highlight29\cf28\b ,\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight27\cf26 "metadata"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "finish_details"\highlight29\cf28\b :\highlight17\cf16\b0  \highlight29\cf28\b \{\highlight27\cf26\b0 "type"\h